  "content_body": "Starting Preschool\n\nIt seems like only yesterday you were swaddling your little one...and now he's on his way to school. And while he's learning his ABCs, you'll be learning how to adjust to a new schedule. Read on for tips on better ways to get your preschooler ready in the a.m. (without rushing!) and what to pack in that in that cuter-than-cute lunch box.\n\nIn This Section\n\nThinking About Preschool\n\nChoosing a Preschool\n\nBefore Preschool Begins\n\nSchool-Year Strategies\n\nLatest\n\nWhat Parents Are Saying...\n\nMore than 1,500 people are talking about the preschool years in our community groups.\n\nGo to Your Toddler's Month\n\nThe educational health content on What To Expect is reviewed by our medical review board and team of experts to be up-to-date and in line with the latest evidence-based medical information and accepted health guidelines, including the medically reviewed What to Expect books by Heidi Murkoff. This educational content is not medical or diagnostic advice. Use of this site is subject to our terms of use and privacy policy. © 2005-2026 Everyday Health, Inc., a Ziff Davis company.\n\nOpens a new window",
